<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39380" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pūbens</span></b> , entis, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>arrived at the age of puberty</i>, <i>pubescent</i> (<b>poet.</b>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: frater, Claud. Cons. Prob. et Olybr.
			142: anni, Aus. Idyll. ap. Monos. Membr. 12, 2.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of plants, <i>in full
				vigor</i>, <i>juicy</i>, <i>flourishing</i>, <i>exuberant</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">herbae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 126</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. A. 4, 514</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frondes salicum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Ep. 2, 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gramina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Idyll. 10, 203</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rosae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 3, 3, 129</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
